{"5234140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"INTERSECTION I","steam_appid":5234140,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERSECTION I is an interactive audiovisual work composed through music, image, and space.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through an ambient, cinematic environment at your own pace. Listening and remaining are as much a part of the work as moving forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human \/ Machine \/ Memory \/ Nature<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These elements cross, separate, and return through sound and moving image. The work unfolds as a space to inhabit and a sequence to experience.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTERSECTION I is an interactive audiovisual work composed through music, image, and space.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through an ambient, cinematic environment at your own pace. Listening and remaining are as much a part of the work as moving forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human \/ Machine \/ Memory \/ Nature<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These elements cross, separate, and return through sound and moving image. The work unfolds as a space to inhabit and a sequence to experience.<\/p>","short_description":"INTERSECTION I is an interactive audiovisual work shaped by music, image, and space. Walk, listen, and remain within an ambient, cinematic landscape where Human, Machine, Memory, and Nature quietly meet and dissolve.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5234140\/64df3a6f9d1673c508d9ca3e11af5c94bbf04b72\/header.jpg?t=1793724092","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5234140\/ef0de8fa71d43be9e6f66087a37e2cf6223d6280\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724092","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5234140\/ef0de8fa71d43be9e6f66087a37e2cf6223d6280\/ca